    "text": "If $\\mathrm{I}_1=\\int_0^{\\pi / 4} \\sin ^2 \\mathrm{x} d \\mathrm{x}$ and $\\mathrm{I}_2=\\int_0^{\\pi / 4} \\cos ^2 \\mathrm{x} d \\mathrm{x}$, then,"
